  "content": "\n\n<h1><strong>此模組需要安裝 Create 或 Sable 才能運作</strong></h1>\n<p>此功能允許玩家在來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lets-do-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[let's do] furniture</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/another-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">another furniture</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/handcrafted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">handcrafted</a> 的家具上乘坐，並可將其安裝於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 的機械結構與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sable</a> 的次級結構上（適用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-aeronautics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create:Aeronautics</a>）。</p>",
